Bundled rmDOS assets
--------------------
`roms/u18.bin`, `roms/u19.bin`, and `disks/fd.img` are clean-room rmDOS system
ROMs and a 720 KB boot floppy. They are included for convenience under the same
MIT license and copyright as this repository (Copyright (c) 2026 Elliot Stirling).
Rebuilds may be taken from the companion [rmDOS](https://github.com/Trugath/rmdos)
tree when developing both projects together.

IBM CGA character ROM
---------------------
`k8086-emulator/.../cga_font_8x8.bin` is the IBM CGA 8×8 text font (CP437),
sourced as IBM CGA.F08 from the
[vga-text-mode-fonts](https://github.com/viler-int10h/vga-text-mode-fonts)
collection. Hardware character-generator data; redistributed here for accurate
CGA text rendering. See also `CgaFont.kt`.

SingleStepTests (optional Git submodules)
-----------------------------------------
`testdata/8086`, `testdata/8088`, and `testdata/80286` are Git submodules of
[SingleStepTests](https://github.com/SingleStepTests) hardware-generated CPU
conformance corpora (MIT License, Copyright Daniel Balsom and contributors).
They are not required to build or run the emulator; initialize them only when
running the `singleStep*` Gradle tasks. The 8088 corpus is large (multi-GB).

